> target STI 0.50), a redundant-channel obligation (audible, visual/
> digital, staffed) for every safety-critical, boarding-critical, and
> IROPS message, an explicit PA governance model (message categories,
> zones, pre-authorized override, IROPS carve-out, tenant broadcast
> discipline), and a two-airport variance clause that recognizes DCA's
> higher operational floor and IAD's international/reverberant terminal
> geometry. Compliance is verified in occupied conditions at commissioning
